This licence covers the SOURCE CODE only.

No DOOM art, audio or map data is contained in this repository or in any jar it
builds. Those are read at runtime from an IWAD the player already owns. DOOM and
its assets are the property of id Software.

The jar bundles freedoom2.wad from the Freedoom project, used when the player
has no IWAD of their own. It is the Freedoom contributors' work under the BSD
3-clause licence, reproduced in the jar as LICENSE_freedoom.
